@startuml
actor User
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Backend" as Backend

User -> Frontend: 输入账号和密码
Frontend -> Backend: 发送登录请求
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend: 调用登录接口
alt 用户不存在
    Backend --> Frontend: 返回用户不存在提示
else 密码错误
    Backend --> Frontend: 返回密码错误提示
else 登录成功
    Backend -> Backend: 调用用户查询方法
    activate Backend
    Backend -> Backend: 查询用户信息
    Backend -> Backend: 检查密码是否匹配
    Backend -> Backend: 查询用户权限
    Backend -> Backend: 查询用户导航菜单
    Backend -> Backend: 生成令牌
    Backend --> Frontend: 返回登录成功结果及令牌
end
Frontend --> User: 显示登录结果
deactivate Backend
@enduml
